# This repo is authored on Windows but every consumer is Linux or a browser:
# the Actions runners execute the workflow YAML and the shell blocks inside it,
# and GitHub renders the SVGs. Normalise to LF in the repository so a CRLF
# checkout never leaks into a `run:` block or an SVG attribute.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
